Noxfell is a small town on the Athrean side of the Elbra mountain range, technically under [[Geography/Althane/Athrea/Thyropae/index|Thyropae]]. It lies near the country travelers would expect to find [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Nox|Nox]], but firmly inside [[Geography/Althane/Athrea/index|Athrea]] rather than [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]]. An almanac of the lands north of [[Geography/Althane/The Hollow/index|the Hollow]] lists it among the local places.
